A||||4||BPacholka||88 parts on 85GT||||5||
Z||000000||BPacholka||10-22-2001||07:31 AM||||I have an opportunity to get an 88 coupe for a very low price. It is a basic version with a bad 4 cyl. I have an 85GT V6. <BR>Q1.The interior in the 88 is showroom perfect and I want to know if it will be a direct swap into my 85.<BR>Q2. Will the coupe body panels switch with the GT? I know the front fascia is different, but how about the rest of the panels. I want to be able to use my lower GT moldings when all is said and done.<BR>Q3. Is there anything on the 88 that was upgraded and can be swapped over to the 85. ie brakes, sensors, etc.||||reg||5
Z||000001||revin||10-22-2001||07:47 AM||||I would move the v6 over to the 88gt. much better car all around.||||reg||1
Z||000002||Indiana_resto_guy||10-22-2001||09:12 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by revin:<BR><B>I would move the v6 over to the 88gt. much better car all around.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>A very good Idea!<BR>Definitely the way to deal with the situation!<BR>||||reg||6
Z||000003||Raydar||10-22-2001||09:19 AM||||The 88 had a completely redesigned suspension and braking system. The 88 cradle can be installed in the earlier cars with some adapters to relocate the struts, but coil-overs will be required. The 88 front suspension is, for all practical matters, not able to be swapped into the earler cars.<BR>(One guy on this Forum has done it, but it involved a lot of cutting and fabrication.) <BR>Interior pieces are interchangeable. <BR>IMHO, if your GT is trashed, the easiest option would be to swap your V-6 into the 88. Will require a different front engine mount, maybe a different exhaust Y-pipe, and not much else. Use your V-6 harness and computer. <BR>All of the GT bodywork, including ground effects and fascias, can be installed on the 88. <BR>Several folks on this forum have done similar swaps (engine and/or body), with great success. You can search for info. Link is at the top of the page.<P>Welcome to the Forum.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000004||88CoupeV6||10-22-2001||12:04 PM||||I would also use the 88. Not a bad swap to change the motor over. I love 88's  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsig.jpg">    <BR>:D  <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||7
